WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:04.537
You guys, the U.S. Open
is this week,

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:06.572 line:0%
and their partner, Heineken,
wants to help bring

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:08.674 line:0%
more New Yorkers to the open.

00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:09.908 line:0%
-That's right, Seth.

00:00:09.908 --> 00:00:11.177
-Oh, I'm sorry everybody.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:12.745
This is one of my writers,
John Lutz.

00:00:12.745 --> 00:00:14.247
Lutz, why are you wearing that?

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:16.082
-I just got back
from the U.S. Open.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.383
-You just got back?

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:19.652
You realize you were supposed
to be working today?

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:23.322
-I know, but why would I do that
when Heineken is having

00:00:23.322 --> 00:00:24.857
this really fun promotion?

00:00:24.857 --> 00:00:26.459
Want me to tell you about it?

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:27.694
-Now?

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:28.795
-When else?

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.165
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.400
The Heineken US Bus
drove around New York

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.169
during the U.S. Open and brought
New Yorkers to see it for free,

00:00:37.169 --> 00:00:40.740
and it just so happened that I
scored one of those seats.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.775
Man, oh man, you should have
seen me play.

00:00:42.775 --> 00:00:44.677
-Wait, I thought the bus was
just taking you

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:46.813
to watch the U.S. Open,
not play in it.

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:48.514
-Well, that's where
you're wrong

00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:50.349
because I played doubles.

00:00:50.349 --> 00:00:51.451
Right, Wally?

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.019
-That's right.
-Ugh.

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:54.354
Not you too, Wally?

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:56.322
-What?
Lutz and I won mixed doubles.

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:58.591
-That's not how
any of this works.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:00:59.993
-Yes, it is.

00:00:59.993 --> 00:01:03.963
Seth, come on, you're giving us
zero love.

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:04.997
-Advantage Lutz.

00:01:04.997 --> 00:01:06.699
-Ugh!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:08.101
Stop with the tennis puns.

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:09.868
Heineken reminds you
that Heineken cans

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:12.639
are the best choice
for warm-Weather settings,

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:13.706
so drink Heineken.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:17.410
-And be sporty like me!

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:18.611
Wink!
[ Tink! ]

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:20.980
-And me. Wink!
[ Tink! ]

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:23.883
-Why do you wink
and say "wink?"

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:25.785
You don't need to do both.

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:26.886
-Got it.

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.488
Wink!

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:31.690
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:34.193
[ Laughs ]

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:36.529 line:0%
-We'll be right back with more
"Late Night," everybody.

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:38.731 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:45.705 line:0%
♪♪

